1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,440
(Sheldon:)You okay?

2
00:00:02,335 --> 00:00:04,445
(Amy:)Just really glad you're back.

3
00:00:04,638 --> 00:00:05,638
(Penny:)Me, too.

4
00:00:07,374 --> 00:00:09,154
(Sheldon:)I got a lot of TV to catch up on.

5
00:00:15,482 --> 00:00:17,052
(Amy:)I missed you.

6
00:00:17,884 --> 00:00:20,294
To quote Han Solo, "I know."

7
00:00:24,891 --> 00:00:27,001
(Amy:)Did you miss me?

8
00:00:27,127 --> 00:00:29,467
(Sheldon:)I would've preferred
to have you there with me.

9
00:00:29,562 --> 00:00:30,542
(Leonard:)Oh...

10
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:32,411
(Sheldon:)Or instead of me.

11
00:00:35,902 --> 00:00:37,812
(Amy:)Did you hold the baby?

12
00:00:37,904 --> 00:00:39,884
-l did.
-And?

13
00:00:40,674 --> 00:00:42,884
(Amy:)How did it make you feel?

14
00:00:43,009 --> 00:00:45,579
(Sheldon:)Looking into the blank, innocent eyes

15
00:00:45,679 --> 00:00:49,149
(Sheldon:)of a creature that couldn't begin to
comprehend anything I was saying?

16
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:58,019
(Sheldon:)Basically just another day
at the office.

